        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p><a href="https://www.tetonarts.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Teton Arts&#8217;</a> ability to keep our programs affordable for everyone in our community is directly related to the support we receive from Tin Cup.&nbsp; Thanks to the annual boost in donor support matched by challenger funds we can offer art experiences for participants below a price point considered profitable.&nbsp; With this consistent and growing funding source, we are able to offer creative experiences specifically suited for seniors, kids, and adults in our community.&nbsp;</p>

<p>Tin Cup Funds truly are the foundation of our financial strategy, providing solid support as we grow programming in our pursuit to keep creative experiences affordable as we expand to engage larger portions of our community.&nbsp; Without Tin Cup, we would struggle to provide subsidized art classes and our greatly utilized scholarships.&nbsp; Partnered with our communities’ support through Tin Cup, we joyously work to make creative experiences affordable and accessible for everyone in our community!</p>

<p>Gregory Meyers, Executive Director, Teton Arts</p>
